# monorepo-machine re-link artifacts (ruling R-E): npm prunes these once oathe-runtime
# is no longer a declared dependency; `npm run link-runtime` recreates the symlink on monorepo
# machines, but it must never ride a commit again.
node_modules/oathe-runtime
node_modules/.bin/oathe-runtime-*

